{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "service": "ulta",
  "description": "US en-US search, prices, product details/options/images, and PowerReviews bodies/photos/rating pagination are read through anonymous direct HTTP APIs. Current first-party page configuration is held in process memory; no customer account or reviewer-profile data is used.",
